**Status**: accepted
**Date**: 2026-07-16
**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki (agent-executed, standing authorization)
**Related**: ADR-2607121000 (Wave 3, production/robotics), ADR-2607152500
(Wave 4, human-facing/personal services -- authorizes this batch to
